:"red millet"},{"surface":"பரப்பி","parts":[{"text":"பரப்பு","lemma":"parappu","gloss":"spread"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"having (past participle)"}],"gloss":"having spread"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சுனைபாய்","parts":[{"text":"சுனை","lemma":"cuṉai","gloss":"mountain pool"},{"text":"பாய்","lemma":"pāy","gloss":"plunge"}],"gloss":"plunging into the mountain pool"},{"surface":"சோர்விடை","parts":[{"text":"சோர்வு","lemma":"cōrvu","gloss":"inattention"},{"text":"இடை","lemma":"iṭai","gloss":"interval"}],"gloss":"moment of inattention"},{"surface":"நோக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கு","lemma":"nōkku","gloss":"watch"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"having (past participle)"}],"gloss":"having watched"},{"surface":"சினையிழிந்து","parts":[{"text":"சினையிழிந்து","lemma":"சினையிழிந்து","gloss":"having descended from the branch"}],"gloss":"having descended from the branch","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பைங்கண்","parts":[{"text":"பைங்கண்","lemma":"பைங்கண்","gloss":"green-eyed"}],"gloss":"green-eyed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மந்தி","parts":[{"text":"மந்தி","lemma":"manti","gloss":"female monkey"}],"gloss":"female monkey"},{"surface":"பார்ப்போடு","parts":[{"text":"பார்ப்பு","lemma":"pārppu","gloss":"young one"},{"text":"ஓடு","lemma":"ōṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with its young one"},{"surface":"கவரும்","parts":[{"text":"கவர்","lemma":"kavar","gloss":"snatch"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"relative participle"}],"gloss":"snatching"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெற்பிடை","parts":[{"text":"வெற்பு","lemma":"veṟpu","gloss":"mountain"},{"text":"இடை","lemma":"iṭai","gloss":"in"}],"gloss":"in the mountain"},{"surface":"நண்ணியதுவே","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணியதுவே","lemma":"நண்ணியதுவே","gloss":"indeed is near"}],"gloss":"indeed is near","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வார்கோல்","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"vār","gloss":"long"},{"text":"கோல்","lemma":"kōl","gloss":"shaft/arrow"}],"gloss":"long shaft"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வல்வில்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"strong"},{"text":"வில்","lemma":"vil","gloss":"bow"}],"gloss":"strong bow"},{"surface":"கானவர்","parts":[{"text":"கானவர்","lemma":"கானவர்","gloss":"foresters"}],"gloss":"foresters","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தங்கை","parts":[{"text":"தங்கை","lemma":"taṅkai","gloss":"younger sister"}],"gloss":"younger sister"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருந்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"perumai","gloss":"broad/great"},{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"tōḷ","gloss":"shoulder"}],"gloss":"broad shoulders"},{"surface":"கொடிச்சி","parts":[{"text":"கொடிச்சி","lemma":"koṭicci","gloss":"mountain girl"}],"gloss":"mountain girl"},{"surface":"இருந்த","parts":[{"text":"இருந்த","lemma":"இருந்த","gloss":"who lived"}],"gloss":"who lived","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ūr","gloss":"village"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the village indeed"}]}],"literal":"Women with fine ornaments on forearms with rows of bangles / having spread red millet on wide rock-ledges of dark stone, / watching for the moment of inattention when they plunge into mountain pools, descending from branches / green-eyed female monkeys with their young ones snatch [the millet] / in the mountain, indeed near is [the village], of the younger sister of foresters with strong bows and long shafts, / the mountain girl with broad shoulders, the village where she lived.","translation":"The women with fine ornaments on forearms adorned with rows of bangles spread red millet to dry on the wide rock-ledges of the dark mountain. Watching for their moment of inattention when they plunge into the mountain pools, green-eyed female monkeys with their young ones descend from the branches and snatch the grain. In this very mountain lies the village where she lives—the broad-shouldered mountain girl, the younger sister of the foresters who carry strong bows and long arrows.","modern":"வரிசையான வளையல்களை அணிந்த முன்கைகளையும் சிறந்த அணிகலன்களையும் உடைய பெண்கள், கரிய பெரிய பாறையின் அகன்ற பரப்பில் செந்தினையைக் காயவைத்துப் பரப்பினர். அவர்கள் சுனைநீரில் குதித்து விளையாடும் கவனக்குறைவான நேரத்தைப் பார்த்து, பசிய கண்களையுடைய பெண் குரங்கு தன் குட்டியோடு மரக்கிளையிலிருந்து இறங்கி வந்து அத்தினையைக் கவர்ந்து செல்லும். அத்தகைய மலையிடத்தே உள்ளது, நீண்ட அம்புகளையும் வலிமையான வில்லையும் உடைய கானவர்களின் தங்கையான, பருத்த தோள்களைக் கொண்ட குறிஞ்சி நிலப் பெண்ணாகிய தலைவி வாழும் ஊர்.","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) speaks to the hero (talaivaṉ) who has been coming for secret trysts, subtly urging him to seek a formal marriage. She describes the mountain landscape where the heroine lives, pointing out that her village is very close. The image of the green-eyed female monkey watching for a moment of distraction to steal the millet represents how others (like the heroine's family or villagers) might discover their secret love if they are careless. The mention of her brothers as foresters with strong bows and long arrows serves as a gentle warning of the dangers of delaying the marriage. This rich imagery of the mountain slopes, wild monkeys, and foresters perfectly aligns with the Kuriñci tiṇai (mountain landscape), which is the setting for union and secret meetings.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,3.85],[3.85,4.32],[4.32,4.78],[4.78,5.4],[5.4,6.66],[6.66,7.6],[7.6,7.8],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,8.89],[8.89,9.41],[9.41,9.93],[9.93,10.62],[10.62,11.31],[11.31,12.0],[12.0,12.4],[12.4,13.2],[13.2,13.6],[13.67,14.0],[14.07,14.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,4.57],[4.57,5.09],[5.09,5.61],[5.61,6.3],[6.3,6.97],[6.97,7.48],[7.48,8.32],[8.32,9.0],[9.0,9.57],[9.57,9.91],[9.91,10.25],[10.25,10.71],[10.71,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.5,13.98],[13.98,14.59],[14.59,15.07],[15.07,15.56],[15.56,15.8]]},"sync":[[["நிரைவளை","row of bangles"]],[["முன்கை","forearm"]],[["நேரிழை","fine ornaments"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["இருங்கல்","dark stone"]],[["வியலறை","wide rock-ledge"],["செந்தினை","red millet"]],[["செந்தினை","red millet"]],[["பரப்பி","having spread"]],[["சுனைபாய்","plunging into the mountain pool"]],[["சோர்விடை","moment of inattention"]],[["நோக்கி","having watched"],["சினையிழிந்து","having descended from the branch"]],[["சினையிழிந்து","having descended from the branch"]],[["பைங்கண்","green-eyed"]],[["மந்தி","female monkey"]],[["பார்ப்போடு","with its young one"]],[["கவரும்","snatching"]],[["வெற்பிடை","in the mountain"]],[["நண்ணியதுவே","indeed is near"]],[["நண்ணியதுவே","indeed is near"]],[["வார்கோல்","long shaft"]],[["வல்வில்","strong bow"]],[["கானவர்","foresters"]],[["தங்கை","younger sister"]],[["பெருந்தோள்","broad shoulders"]],[["கொடிச்சி","mountain girl"]],[["இருந்த","who lived"]],[["ஊரே","the village indeed"]]]}